category: Devel
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Cross-platform asynchronous I/O library for Win32 toolchain"
ldesc: "libuv is a multi-platform support library with
 a focus on asynchronous I/O. It was primarily developed for
 use by Node.js, but it's also used by Luvit, Julia, uvloop
 and others."
